From f0d5629000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: GertaBool <67003432+GertaBool@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 17:45:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Post-merge AI strength, overflow, and graphics paging fixes (pass 2 over c08a472)

Cumulative save-compatible patch over GitLab main c08a472:
1. Diplomacy & resource valuation (Designs A1, 2A, 4C, 5A, G1):
   - Unified 40%/50%/30% surplus-sharing resource reservation floor closing the
     1-GPT spare-resource exploit and aligning deal creation, counterproposals,
     and 20-turn renewal (+ AI-AI outgoing GPT cancellation).
   - Scope calculateGoldRate() clamp in AI_maxGoldPerTurnTrade to AI branch only.
   - Require positive AI_mapTradeVal + CONTACT_TRADE_MAP cooldown on AI-AI map swaps.
   - Add AI_corporationBonusVal == 0 guard and midpoint spare-resource offer weight
     in AI_counterPropose, and 64-bit goldForValueGap in AI_doDiplo tech trades.
   - Add imminent growth-cap happiness/health headroom in AI_bonusCityValue.
2. War power overflows, economy, civics, bombard, Revolution AI & religion helpers
   (Designs B1, C1, D1, E2, F1, 6A):
   - Convert 10+ late-game 32-bit power sites to 64-bit across CvTeamAI, CvPlayerAI,
     and CvCityAI (AI_getEnemyPowerPercent, AI_declareWarTradeVal, AI_surrenderTrade,
     AI_endWarVal, AI_startWarVal, AI_minorKeepWarVal, AI_getBarbarianCivWarVal,
     AI_conquerCity, AI_doVictoryStrategies, AI_cityThreat).
   - Preserve AI culture slider in AI_doCommerce, guard 0%->10% research bump
     against strike, and replace new[]/SAFE_DELETE UB with stack arrays.
   - Fix AI_civicValue Inquisition typo (iValue /= 5 -> iValue += iNonstateReligionCount * 4).
   - Fix AI_RbombardNaval mis-nested loop & zero-multiplying RNG, and guard
     pDefender != NULL in AI_Abombard.
   - Score building Revolution stability modifiers (RevIdx) in AI_buildingValueThreshold
     when Revolutions is enabled.
   - Fix assignment typos (= -> ==) in hasStateReligionHolyCity and hasStateReligionShrine.
3. Graphics paging priority, critical shrink, deferred route drain & entity sync
   (Designs 3A, 4A, 7B):
   - Center-out Chebyshev ring page-in + non-serialized m_iPagingOutCursor
     round-robin page-out in CvGame::pageGraphics.
   - Live camera recenter during m_bPagingPending and immediate critical-pressure
     window shrink (bypassing GRAPHICS_PAGING_SHRINK_MS at pressure level 2).
   - Bounded off-window deferred route symbol drain via CvPlot::refreshRevealedRouteOnly().
   - Symmetric post-setup m_bGraphicsPagedOut clearing in CvCity/CvUnit::pageGraphics(true)
     plus post-setup unit position/flag sync.

Serves: P16
